note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note OM-1 twin of l5-shactx.om (contract 163-165): the sha256_ctx image written byte by byte,
note little endian. Expected stdout oracle/s5s7/exp/l5-shactx.out (python3 struct, gcc offsetof).
note 270544960 = 0x10203040, 81985529216486895 = 0x0123456789abcdef.
fn stle c edit uchar 104 o ulong v ulong n ulong to void
x = v
for i ulong n
put c add o i uchar and x 255
x = shr x 8
end
end
fn main to int
c = new uchar 104 0
for i ulong 8
stle c mul i 4 add 270544960 i 4
end
stle c 32 81985529216486895 8
for j ulong 64
put c add 40 j uchar add mul j 3 1
end
w = write 1 c 0 104
ret 0
end
